What a scrolled frame repaints, traced (Kosmos testing.md 18.856). With
0038's trace on, the web process hands each scrolled display's dirty
rectangles, their bounds, the scroll and whether the bounds are painted
whole to the port's KosmosFrameTimes.cpp, which tallies the area painted
and says the first few frames' rectangles.

